<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108463" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποικ-ουρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>keep house, stay at home,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				11.32
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακὸν ὑ. ἐν τῇ ψυχῇ</span>”
				<i>lurks, lies hidden,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Abd.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢν μὴ ὑποικουρέωσι φλεγμοναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			; esp. in part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμορφία ὑποικουροῦσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Gall.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῖσος τὸ ὑποικουροῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					17.5.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				31.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>engage in</i> or <i>plot underhand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἃ . . -εῖτε τοῖσιν ἀνδράσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					1168
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				42
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποικουρουμένη ὀργή</span>
			anger <i>secretly cherished,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.49.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.11.3
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -ημένα</span> the <i>plot,
				intrigue,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.202
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.
			pers., <i>work secretly upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν στρατιάν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Luc.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήμασι πολλοὺς ἄρχοντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					58
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσος ὑ. αὐτούς</span>
			<i>crept in among</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> abs.,
				<i>intrigue,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Oth.</u>
				3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
